{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26299","headline":"曲江亭望慈恩杏花发 · 沈亚之","name":"曲江亭望慈恩杏花发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲台晴好望，近接梵王家。\n十亩开金地，千株发杏花。\n带云犹误雪，映日欲欺霞。\n紫陌传香远，红泉落影斜。\n园中春尚早，亭上路非赊。\n芳景偏堪赏，其如积岁华。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈亚之","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26299.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26299","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}